# in ./virtiofsd: QEMU, dnsmasq, RunCVM's scripts and tools, and runc's own after it loads the
# filter (before it runs the container's init): the calls those processes make across RunCVM's
# configurations (disks, filesystems, display modes, networks, --init and more). io_uring's calls
# are not listed: runcvm-runtime adds them only for a Container/VM with disks that may use
# io_uring. get_mempolicy, set_mempolicy and mbind are for QEMU's memory backend, which calls them
